@startuml UC01_Backend_Sequence
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F0F9FF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #0284C7

title Lược đồ Tuần tự (Sequence Diagram) - UC01 (Backend): Kiến trúc 3 Lớp trong POI Service & API Gateway

participant "Client Web App\n(client-web/app.js)" as Client
participant "API Gateway\n(Spring Cloud :8080)" as Gateway
participant "PoiController\n(Controller Layer :8082)" as Controller
participant "PoiService\n(Service Layer)" as Service
participant "PoiRepository\n(Repository Layer)" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL 15\n(Bảng pois & poi_audio_contents)" as Postgres
database "Redis 7 GEO\n(Key: pois_geo)" as Redis

== Khởi động Dịch vụ: Đồng bộ Cache Không gian (@PostConstruct) ==
activate Service
Service -> Repo : 1. initRedisGeoCache() -> findByIsActiveTrue()
activate Repo
Repo -> Postgres : 2. SELECT * FROM pois WHERE is_active = true
activate Postgres
Postgres --> Repo : 3. Danh sách 6 di tích Quận 1
deactivate Postgres
Repo --> Service : 4. List<Poi>
deactivate Repo
Service -> Redis : 5. GEOADD pois_geo lng lat poiId
activate Redis
Redis --> Service : 6. Đã nạp vào RAM (< 20ms truy xuất)
deactivate Redis
deactivate Service

== Truy vấn Danh sách Điểm Tham quan Lân cận (UC01) ==
Client -> Gateway : 7. GET /api/v1/pois?lat=10.7769&lng=106.6953&radius=3000&lang=en
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Controller : 8. Chuyển tiếp route poi-service-route (:8082)
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : 9. findNearby(lat, lng, radius, lang)
activate Service

Service -> Repo : 10. findNearbyPois(lat, lng, radiusM)
activate Repo
Repo -> Postgres : 11. Thực thi SQL công thức cầu Haversine\n(WHERE is_active = true AND distance <= radiusM ORDER BY distance ASC)
activate Postgres
Postgres --> Repo : 12. Trả về các bản ghi Poi + audioContents
deactivate Postgres
Repo --> Service : 13. List<Poi>
deactivate Repo

loop Duyệt từng Poi trong danh sách
    Service -> Service : 14. calculateDistance(lat, lng, poi.lat, poi.lng)\nmapToResponse(poi, lang, distance)\n(Tìm audio theo lang, nếu thiếu tự động Fallback về 'vi')
end

Service --> Controller : 15. List<PoiResponse>
deactivate Service

Controller --> Gateway : 16. ResponseEntity.ok(pois) (HTTP 200 OK)
deactivate Controller
Gateway --> Client : 17. Trả về mảng JSON các điểm di tích Quận 1
deactivate Gateway
@enduml
